Bridge includes code adapted from:

- Shizuku (https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku), Apache License 2.0
  Copyright Rikka and contributors. The ADB client in
  android/app/src/main/java/com/bonevane/bridge/AdbClient.kt is adapted
  from manager/src/main/java/moe/shizuku/manager/adb/.

- scrcpy (https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy), Apache License 2.0
  Copyright Romain Vimont and contributors. The phone runs an unmodified
  scrcpy-server (fetched by android/scripts/fetch-scrcpy-server.sh) for
  capture and input; the Mac speaks its stream protocol.

- dumbpipe and iroh (https://github.com/n0-computer), MIT or Apache License 2.0
  Copyright n0, inc. The phone bundles an unmodified dumbpipe binary
  (android/scripts/fetch-dumbpipe.sh) for the tunnel.
